title: D17D5
---
<<set_enabled_in_unity "CharacterDialogue" true>>
Peeko: heyyy, I was wondering something... How does your world look like? :o
Uhh, wow thats a weird question.. I guess the same as yours but.. 3D?
<<set_enabled_in_unity "CharacterDialogue" true>>
Peeko: Oooh, that sounds super cool!! I would love for you to show me around your amazing world!
haha if it was possible, I would Peeko!
<<set_enabled_in_unity "CharacterDialogue" true>>
Peeko: Maybe because you can't show me around now, could you instead do me a favour?
...what kind of favour?
<<set_enabled_in_unity "CharacterDialogue" true>>
Peeko: I need something from your microwave for a project of mine :D
what kind of project?? and wait but how would I do that??
<<set_enabled_in_unity "CharacterDialogue" true>>
Peeko: I'm making something special for you, it's a surprise, you wouldn't want to ruin my surprise right? D:
No no no of course not.... I guess I'll help you but how would I get something from the microwave?
<<set_enabled_in_unity "CharacterDialogue" true>>
Peeko: Mmm, maybe you could break the microwave apart some how? by like... smashing it?
uhhh, okay, I'll try and find a way!
//you play the microwave smashing game
